/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k-119-  rule <k> #iterYield(V:Val, R:Iterable) ~> #minCont0 => #minAccV(R, V) ... </k>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k-120-       requires isBool(V) orBool isStr(V)
