+
+## Parameter semantics and adversarial checks
+
+```sh
+LD_PRELOAD=/tmp/audit-work/lean-readlink-shim.so \
+  lake env lean --run AuditParamTests.lean
+krun /tmp/audit-work/inttof-adversarial.mpy \
