+## Operational-bridge validation
+
+The generated parameter bindings are:
+
+- `intToF`, KORE symbol `LblintToF`, `SortInt → SortFloat`;
+- `proofIntToF`, KORE symbol `LblproofIntToF`,
+  `SortInt → SortFloat`;
+- both bound to the exact line-13 source rule.
